id: sleek-design
name: Sleek Design
kind: crafting
categories: armor
slots: 1
# "Halve the Damage Reduction gained from this Armor." Read by the Armor Category's Damage
# Reduction, as a multiplier on it.
armorDamageReduction: 0.5
# "This Armor does not count towards your Apparel Penalty." Read by the Penalty.
noApparelPenalty: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Half the Damage Reduction from this Armor, and out of the Apparel Penalty.
text: >
  Sleek Design: Light and flexible, this armor allows for a freer range of motion, but provides
  less protection.
  –Apparel Category: Armor
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Halve the Damage Reduction gained from this Armor. This Armor does not count towards
  your Apparel Penalty.

---

# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Armor's Damage Reduction and the Apparel Penalty come with the rest of the Apparel rules.
# The Damage Reduction reads its multiplier - a half, here - from its piece's reading
# (`armorDamageReduction`), and the Penalty leaves this piece out, as it does Lightweight's.
